	(text "Slot 0: Link, link card (RS-485 bridge, PTT and KILL loops).\nNo RF on the link slot: RF positions not connected.\nSLOT_ID3..0 = 0000: a 0 bit is strapped to GND, a 1 bit is open (pull-up on the card).\nPins b20 to b32 and all other unlabelled contacts: see pin-out on the root sheet."
